    {
      "name": "Seed Spray",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "cold",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The calathgar expels thorny, frozen seeds in a 15ft Cone, dealing 1d6 Piercing Damage|options:area-damage]{1d6 piercing and 4d6 cold} damage (Basic DC 20 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>In mild cold or colder environments, these seeds cling to living creatures they strike, dealing 1d4 Persistent,cold Damage damage.</p>\n<p>The calathgar can't use Seed Spray again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
